  </div>
  <div class="why-grid">
    <div class="why-card">
      <div class="why-icon">🏥</div>
      <h4>15,000+ Hospitals</h4>
      <p>Pan-India network with top-rated hospitals for cashless treatment.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="why-card">
      <div class="why-icon">⚡</div>
      <h4>Fast Claim Settlement</h4>
      <p>99% claim settlement ratio. Most claims processed within 24 hours.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="why-card">
      <div class="why-icon">💰</div>
